# ClosePilot needs no .env file, API keys or tokens.
#
# The only secret is the Finance Reviewer's secret, and it must NOT be written to a file
# (agents can read files in this repository). Set it in your own shell for the session:
#
#   Git Bash:   read -rs CLOSEPILOT_REVIEWER_SECRET && export CLOSEPILOT_REVIEWER_SECRET
#   PowerShell: see README.md, "Human reviewer commands"
#
# Optional, for the agent wrapper only: instead of switch/local/python, the interpreter
# that has closepilot installed can be given here for your own shell. Switch does not
# pass this variable to agent sessions, so agents still need switch/local/python.
# CLOSEPILOT_PYTHON=/path/to/python
